---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="企业礼赠｜小民艺术" description="为客户答谢、员工福利、会议礼品、开业庆典和节日慰问准备有文化温度的企业礼赠。">
  <section class="container page-head"><span class="eyebrow">Business Gifts / 企业礼赠</span><h1 class="serif">一份有文化温度的礼，<br />替企业好好表达。</h1><p lang="en">Corporate gifts with a quieter kind of warmth.</p><p>区别于大型空间定制，企业礼赠从数量、预算、包装和一句企业想说的话开始，更适合客户答谢、员工福利、会议礼品、开业庆典与节日慰问。</p></section>
  <section class="container section biz-directions" aria-labelledby="biz-dir-title"><div class="section-lead"><span class="eyebrow">Corporate Gifting / 企业礼赠</span><h2 id="biz-dir-title" class="serif">书法，是一种褪去火气的表达。</h2><p>不喧哗，也不套路。对企业而言，它还是一种契约记录——落笔为凭，把说过的话、走过的年份留在纸上；也是一份对外的文化内核，别人从一幅字里看见的，是企业愿意被记住的那一面。</p><p class="dir-note">下面五个方向，是我们与企业最常一起完成的五件事。</p></div><div class="dir-list">
    <article id="dir-client" class="dir-item"><span class="mono dir-no">01</span><div><h3 class="serif">客户答谢伴手礼</h3><p>把「谢谢」写进一份带得走的心意。装裱完成的小品或定制卡笺，附企业落款贺卡，轻而不薄，单件也有分量。</p><span class="dir-scenes">适用场景：客户拜访答谢、沙龙伴手礼、供应商答谢、年会随手礼</span></div></article>
    <article id="dir-commemorative" class="dir-item"><span class="mono dir-no">02</span><div><h3 class="serif">企业纪念定制书法</h3><p>周年、开业、里程碑——把属于企业自己的那句话写成书法原作。附唯一编号与藏品证书，纪念感来自「世间没有第二幅」。</p></div></article>
    <article id="dir-festival" class="dir-item"><span class="mono dir-no">03</span><div><h3 class="serif">节日限定书法礼套装</h3><p>春节、中秋与周年庆典的节日主题套装：书法作品 + 节日主题包装 + 手写贺卡。批量交付需要提前规划，建议尽早确认数量与交期。</p></div></article>
    <article id="dir-checkin" class="dir-item"><span class="mono dir-no">04</span><div><h3 class="serif">活动签到伴手礼</h3><p>签到台上的一份小礼：小品卡笺或扇面，单件成本可控，却比印刷品更有文化气质。适合沙龙、发布会与行业交流活动。</p></div></article>
    <article id="dir-space" class="dir-item"><span class="mono dir-no">05</span><div><h3 class="serif">企业空间书法软装</h3><p>会客厅、前台与走廊的书法软装：按空间尺度、光线与气质定制内容与装裱，让企业自己的话，挂在每天看得见的墙上。</p></div></article>
  </div></section>
  <section class="container plans"><article><span class="mono">01</span><span class="eyebrow">Light / 轻量款</span><h2 class="serif">先从一份标准心意开始。</h2><strong>50 份起订</strong><p>标准图案 + 企业 Logo 卡片，适合会议伴手礼、节日慰问和首次尝试。</p></article><article><span class="mono">02</span><span class="eyebrow">Custom / 定制款</span><h2 class="serif">让包装和内容更贴合品牌。</h2><strong>100 份起订</strong><p>图案、尺寸和包装可以围绕企业场景讨论，适合客户答谢、员工福利和品牌活动。</p></article><article><span class="mono">03</span><span class="eyebrow">Bespoke / 专属款</span><h2 class="serif">从企业自己的语言开始设计。</h2><strong>200 份起订</strong><p>完全专属的创作方向和礼盒方案，适合周年、开业和重要合作关系。</p></article></section>
  <section class="container section business-scenes"><span class="eyebrow">Use cases / 适用场景</span><h2 class="serif">把礼物送到关系发生的地方。</h2><div class="scene-list"><span>客户答谢 / Client appreciation</span><span>员工福利 / Employee gifts</span><span>会议礼品 / Meeting gifts</span><span>开业庆典 / Opening celebration</span><span>节日慰问 / Festival care</span><span>多地址寄送 / Multi-address delivery</span></div><p>如需多地址寄送，可在表单中说明；包裹是否去除价格单据、物流和交期会在项目确认时单独说明。</p></section>
  <section class="container section business-faq"><span class="eyebrow">Corporate FAQ / 企业礼赠 FAQ</span><h2 class="serif">先把批量合作问题说清楚。</h2><div class="faq-grid"><details><summary>起订量是多少？</summary><p>当前方案参考为轻量款 50 份起、定制款 100 份起、专属款 200 份起，最终以确认的方案为准。</p></details><details><summary>可以定制企业 Logo 和品牌元素吗？</summary><p>轻量款支持 Logo 卡片；定制款和专属款可进一步讨论图案、尺寸和包装。</p></details><details><summary>可以先打样再批量吗？</summary><p>可以在项目沟通中提出打样需求，打样范围、费用和时间需单独确认。</p></details><details><summary>能开票或对公转账吗？</summary><p>企业开票和付款方式请在简报中说明，具体主体、票种和节点在项目确认后确定。</p></details><details><summary>可以分地址寄送并去掉价格单据吗？</summary><p>可以提出多地址寄送和去除价格单据的需求，物流方案与执行边界会在确认时说明。</p></details><details><summary>交期需要多久？</summary><p>交期取决于数量、定制深度、包装与配送范围。提交期望时间后，我们会先判断可行性。</p></details><details><summary>包装能否定制企业 VI？</summary><p>定制款和专属款可以讨论企业 VI 的使用范围、包装结构与印刷方式。</p></details><details><summary>没有准备好完整需求也能咨询吗？</summary><p>可以。只要提供大致场景、数量和时间，我们会帮助你梳理下一步。</p></details></div></section>
  <section id="business-form" class="container section business-form"><div><span class="eyebrow">Business needs / 企业项目需求</span><h2 class="serif">把项目背景告诉我们。</h2><p>提交后仅用于初步沟通，不代表报价或排期确认。我们会在两个工作日内回复，并说明下一步需要确认的信息。</p></div><form data-business-form><label>公司名称 / Company<input name="company" required /></label><label>联系人与联系方式 / Contact<input name="contact" required placeholder="微信优先，邮箱或手机号备选" /></label><label>预算范围 / Budget<select name="budget"><option>尚未确定 / To be discussed</option><option>¥10,000 以下</option><option>¥10,000–50,000</option><option>¥50,000 以上</option></select></label><label>预计数量 / Quantity<select name="quantity"><option>50 份起</option><option>100 份起</option><option>200 份起</option><option>尚未确定</option></select></label><label>用途场景 / Use case<select name="scene"><option>客户答谢</option><option>员工福利</option><option>会议礼品</option><option>开业庆典</option><option>节日慰问</option><option>其他</option></select></label><label>期望交付时间 / Timeline<input name="timeline" placeholder="例如：2026 年 12 月前" /></label><label>项目说明 / Brief<textarea name="brief" rows="4" placeholder="品牌背景、希望表达的文化、包装想法等"></textarea></label><label class="honeypot-field" aria-hidden="true">网址 / Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" class="honeypot" /></label><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">提交企业需求 →</button><p class="form-note" data-form-status role="status" aria-live="polite">提交后我们会通过你留下的联系方式回复；如需即时沟通，可加页脚微信并备注「企业礼赠」。</p></form></section>
</Layout>
<script>
  import { submitLead, isHoneypotFilled, CONTACT_FALLBACK } from '../../scripts/cloud-forms';
  const form = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('[data-business-form]');
  if (form) {
    const status = form.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-form-status]');
    const submitButton = form.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('button[type="submit"]');
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      if (!status || !submitButton) return;
      if (isHoneypotFilled(form)) { status.textContent = '企业需求已收到，我们会尽快回复。'; return; }
      const data = new FormData(form);
      const pick = (key: string) => String(data.get(key) || '').trim();
      const company = pick('company');
      const contact = pick('contact');
      if (!company || !contact) { status.textContent = '请补全公司名称与联系方式后再提交。'; return; }
      submitButton.disabled = true;
      status.textContent = '正在提交…';
      const result = await submitLead('business_gift', company, contact, {
        budget: pick('budget'),
        quantity: pick('quantity'),
        scene: pick('scene'),
        timeline: pick('timeline'),
        brief: pick('brief'),
        page: window.location.pathname,
        referrer: document.referrer || null,
      });
      submitButton.disabled = false;
      if (result.ok) {
        status.textContent = '企业需求已收到。我们会在两个工作日内通过你留下的联系方式回复，并说明下一步需要确认的信息。';
        form.reset();
      } else {
        status.textContent = `提交失败，请稍后重试；${CONTACT_FALLBACK}`;
      }
    });
  }
</script>
<style>
  .page-head { padding: 90px 0 66px; } .page-head h1 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 52px); line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0; } .page-head p { max-width: 710px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 18px; } .page-head p[lang='en'] { font: 24px var(--font-display-en), Georgia, serif; color: var(--cinnabar-deep); } .page-head .btn { margin-top: 18px; }
  .business-hero-scenes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .business-hero-scenes img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1.35; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .biz-directions .section-lead { max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 40px; } .biz-directions h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 3.2vw, 40px); font-weight: 500; margin: 14px 0 12px; } .biz-directions .section-lead p { color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0; }
  .dir-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .dir-item { display: flex; gap: 24px; padding: 26px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); scroll-margin-top: 92px; }
  .dir-no { flex: none; font-size: 15px; color: var(--cinnabar-deep); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cinnabar); padding-bottom: 5px; height: fit-content; letter-spacing: .18em; }
  .dir-item h3 { font-size: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 26px); font-weight: 500; margin: 4px 0 10px; }
  .dir-item p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0; max-width: 760px; }
  .dir-scenes { display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px; color: var(--cinnabar-deep); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .dir-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .04em; margin-top: 16px !important; }
  .plans { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); } .plans article { padding: 24px 22px 30px 0; min-height: 300px; } .plans article + article { padding-left: 22px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); } .plans .eyebrow { display: block; margin-top: 24px; } .plans h2 { font-size: 29px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.35; margin: 14px 0; } .plans strong { color: var(--cinnabar-deep); font: 21px var(--font-display-en), Georgia, serif; } .plans p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 14px; }
  .business-scenes, .business-form, .business-faq { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); } .business-scenes h2, .business-form h2, .business-faq h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 40px); font-weight: 500; margin: 18px 0 28px; } .scene-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); } .scene-list span { padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink-soft); } .scene-list span:nth-child(3n+2), .scene-list span:nth-child(3n+3) { padding-left: 20px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); } .business-scenes > p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .business-form { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: 80px; } .business-form > div > p { max-width: 500px; color: var(--ink-soft); } form { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 20px; } label { display: block; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 16px; } input, select, textarea { display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 0; background: var(--paper-light); padding: 11px 12px; } textarea { resize: vertical; } .form-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .faq-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); } .faq-grid details { padding: 18px 20px 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); } .faq-grid details:nth-child(even) { padding-left: 20px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); } .faq-grid summary { cursor: pointer; min-height: 44px; font-weight: 500; } .faq-grid p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 14px; }
  .honeypot-field { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); }
  .honeypot { position: absolute !important; width: 1px !important; height: 1px !important; overflow: hidden !important; clip: rect(0 0 0 0) !important; opacity: 0 !important; pointer-events: none !important; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .business-hero-scenes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; } .business-hero-scenes img { aspect-ratio: 1.3; } .page-head { padding: 56px 0 42px; } .page-head h1 { font-size: 30px; } .page-head p { font-size: 16px; } .page-head p[lang='en'] { font-size: 20px; } .dir-item { gap: 16px; padding: 22px 0; } .plans, .business-form, .scene-list, .faq-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .plans article, .plans article + article { min-height: 0; padding: 22px 0; border-left: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); } .plans article:last-child { border-bottom: 0; } .scene-list span, .scene-list span:nth-child(3n+2), .scene-list span:nth-child(3n+3) { padding: 13px 0; border-left: 0; } .business-form { gap: 28px; } .faq-grid details, .faq-grid details:nth-child(even) { padding: 16px 0; border-left: 0; } }
</style>
